cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use thor, please cite it as below."
title: "thor — Towards Human-Oracle Research"
abstract: >-
  thor (Towards Human-Oracle Research) is a small set of Markdown templates and a
  working practice for running real, multi-week research with AI agents as
  semi-independent assistants. Its core idea is positive disagreement: human and
  agent keep separate, version-controlled belief files, experiments are biased
  toward ones that settle the disagreement, and a fresh skeptic agent reviews every
  plan and result.
type: software
